l intelligence</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">; biotechnology;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">quantum science and engineering</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">nanoengineering</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">microelectronics</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">and other national priorities.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW201714675 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"></span>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW201714675 BCX4\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW201714675 BCX4\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">EER supports research that</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">transforms biotechnolog</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">y</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">and manufactur</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">ing</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">to create</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">domestic</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\"></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">source</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">of energy</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">engineered chemical, biological, and/or geo-physical processes</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">may be involved</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\"></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW201714675 BCX4\">The program<